	(text "Detector and emitter batteries: confirmed 6.4V nominal LiFePO4 packs. Endpoints are not yet verified.\nPositive leads are switched; detector ground remains continuous with USB. EM_GND stays optically isolated.\nQ16/Q19 protect reversed battery polarity. They do not provide reverse-current isolation.\nQ17/Q20 gate capacitors slow edges; they are not precision current limiters. Check inrush and MOSFET SOA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 261.62 0)
